  "notes": [
    "Irregular -ER verb: e→ie stem change in stressed syllables",
    "Stem changes in: Presente (yo/tú/él/ellos) and Subjuntivo Presente (yo/tú/él/ellos); nosotros/nosotras keeps base stem *atend-*",
    "Past participle: atendido (regular)",
    "*Atender a alguien* = to serve/look after someone: *No soporto que me atiendan mal* = I can't stand being served badly",
    "*Atender el teléfono* = to answer the phone",
    "*Atender a una reunión* = to attend a meeting (more formal than *asistir*)",
    "Related: la atención (attention), atento (attentive), el/la dependiente (shop assistant)"
  ],
